as a theme for the dance?


00:04:16.104 --> 00:04:19.562
That's totally un-American.
I don't care if it was my idea.


00:04:21.243 --> 00:04:23.507
Hello.
Oh. Oh.


00:04:23.679 --> 00:04:26.375
I'm Dean Van Ravensway,
and you must be...


00:04:26.548 --> 00:04:29.642
