Guy Morgan.


00:07:02.938 --> 00:07:04.769
Could you give his son, Luke, a tour?


00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:07.807
Sure. Would you like
to see the Wellesley perks?


00:07:07.976 --> 00:07:10.604
Um, yes, brilliant. Sure.


00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:13.070
