00:08:02.797 --> 00:08:06.426
Oh, do you want this?


00:08:11.239 --> 00:08:14.504
She shoots, she scores.
Unlike you, soccer boy.


00:08:16.845 --> 00:08:20.576
Oh, so spill it. Is Luke Morgan
