and you don't even know my name.


00:10:01.016 --> 00:10:02.916
- I'm Mickey O'Malley.
- Mickey O'Malley.


00:10:03.084 --> 00:10:04.711
A rarity in the Irish community.


00:10:05.287 --> 00:10:07.380
Om.


00:10:08.189 --> 00:10:10.817
RAVl: Om.
- Om.


00:10:10.992 --> 00:10:13.085
- Om.
- Om!


00:10:13.261 --> 00:10:15.786
This is not a contest, Ms. Gail.


00:10:16.164 --> 00:10:17.791
Just concentrate on your breathing.


00:10:19.301 --> 00:10:20.461
My butt is numb.


00:10:20.802 --> 00:10:23.999
If your butt is suffering,
then you are suffering.


00:10:24.172 --> 00:10:27.630
In fact, your entire life is suffering. Why?


00:10:27.809 --> 00:10:30.903
Because you crave
that which is meaningless.


00:10:31.079 --> 00:10:33.070
Are you calling me shallow?


00:10:34.149 --> 00:10:39.985
No, I'm saying to stop your craving
