00:10:40.155 --> 00:10:43.716
Just release it. Release it, yeah.
Release that butt.


00:10:44.592 --> 00:10:47.652
<i>Release that butt
Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


00:10:47.829 --> 00:10:50.423
<i>Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


00:10:50.598 --> 00:10:51.895
Mrs. Van Ravensway?


