00:11:57.465 --> 00:11:58.489
<i>Ow.</i>


00:11:58.666 --> 00:12:01.100
<i>What are you doing?
I'm on the phone.</i>


00:12:01.269 --> 00:12:02.861
<i>- I'm cleansing.
Heh, heh.</i>


00:12:03.071 --> 00:12:05.301
Mac and cheese.


00:12:06.207 --> 00:12:09.335
<i>I don't need your spiritual counseling.</i>


00:12:09.878 --> 00:12:11.436
