00:13:01.629 --> 00:13:03.392
Why don't you have another drink, Mom.


00:13:04.933 --> 00:13:07.128
Katie, napkin me.


00:13:07.302 --> 00:13:09.793
I have got to impress Guy Morgan...


00:13:10.205 --> 00:13:13.436
