as soon as he hears me sing.


00:13:24.686 --> 00:13:27.280
- I doubt that.
- No, I've been practicing really hard.


00:13:27.455 --> 00:13:30.322
My voice teacher says
I've transcended to a whole new level.


00:13:30.492 --> 00:13:31.516
Yeah, I doubt it.


00:13:31.693 --> 00:13:34.253
When my first single drops,
I'll buy you that mansion...


00:13:34.429 --> 00:13:36.363
...in the Hollywood Hills...


00:13:36.531 --> 00:13:39.557
...and you can finally afford
to have your legs lengthened.


00:13:39.734 --> 00:13:41.759
- Oh, ba...
- Ms. Gail.


00:13:41.936 --> 00:13:43.904
- Miss Bev has clarity.
Katie.


00:13:44.072 --> 00:13:45.096
- You see...
- Look.


00:13:45.273 --> 00:13:49.141
