for 40 years without any rain.


00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:52.711
But the unemployed salesman
who has recently discovered hydroponics...


00:13:52.881 --> 00:13:55.975
...all of a sudden gets disgusted by the...
- And see? No sense.


00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:58.448
- That didn't make any sense.
- Let me finish. You...


00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:00.554
Oh, I doubt it. You have me pray all day.


00:14:00.722 --> 00:14:02.952
- I don't feel nothing.
- You don't have a soul.


00:14:03.124 --> 00:14:06.321
No, you don't have soul.
- I have a many souls. I'll give you one.


00:14:06.494 --> 00:14:10.760
- Where's your third eye? Turn that thing on.
- I have a fourth eye too. You wanna see it?


00:14:10.932 --> 00:14:12.900
- What?
- Shh.


00:14:13.401 --> 00:14:16.928
I wanna be 6'4". Wow me, Bev.


00:14:19.474 --> 00:14:24.912
<i>Do-re-mi-fa-so-la-ti-do</i>


00:14:25.079 --> 00:14:27.639
Just stop. Stop the wowing, okay?


00:14:27.815 --> 00:14:29.908
What's wrong?
- Somehow you've gotten worse.


00:14:30.084 --> 00:14:31.813
I don't know how that was possible...


00:14:31.986 --> 00:14:34.614
...but there isn't enough Auto-Tune
that's gonna fix you.


00:14:34.789 --> 00:14:38.122
- Well, Katie's bad playing threw me off.
- I don't think it was that.


00:14:38.293 --> 00:14:39.920
Again.


00:14:40.094 --> 00:14:41.652
Really? Okay.


00:14:41.829 --> 00:14:47.461
<i>Do-re-mi-fa-so-la-ti-do</i>


00:14:47.635 --> 00:14:48.761
Ouch.


00:14:48.937 --> 00:14:51.997
I could belch the song better.


00:14:53.608 --> 00:14:55.769
Have you been drinking
the floor wax again?


00:14:55.944 --> 00:14:57.411
Anything to forget I live here.


00:14:57.579 --> 00:15:00.480
Ugh. My head is buzzing
like a skeeter on a septic tank.


00:15:00.648 --> 00:15:04.550
- Ravi, meditate me.
Good luck, buddy.


00:15:04.919 --> 00:15:08.582
Well, it doesn't matter,
because I have my own plan.


00:15:12.794 --> 00:15:15.160
Does it make me a bad person
that I kind of enjoyed that?


00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:17.059
No.


00:15:17.231 --> 00:15:19.529
Hmm. Nice work.


00:15:31.713 --> 00:15:35.012
- Guess who's on his way over.
- Not now, Victor, I'm busy.


00:15:35.183 --> 00:15:37.651
Guess or prepare to get creamed.


00:15:48.129 --> 00:15:51.223
Victor! Victor! Victor, stop!


00:15:56.104 --> 00:15:57.833
<i>I've got rings on my fingers</i>


00:15:58.006 --> 00:15:59.098
<i>And glitter in my hair</i>


00:15:59.273 --> 00:16:03.369
<i>I've got a one-way ticket
And I just got here</i>


00:16:03.544 --> 00:16:04.875
<i>I'm gonna run...</i>


00:16:05.046 --> 00:16:07.810
- Ha-ha-ha.
- Victor, what are you doing?


00:16:08.249 --> 00:16:09.546
Victor!


00:16:09.717 --> 00:16:12.948
Victor, where did you put my clothes?


00:16:13.121 --> 00:16:15.282
- Surprise!
- What? No.


00:16:18.793 --> 00:16:20.420
I'm gonna kill you. Victor!


00:16:30.338 --> 00:16:31.498
Oh, hi, Katie.


00:16:31.673 --> 00:16:33.072
You are evil. Let me in.


00:16:33.241 --> 00:16:36.677
I control every lock on this property.


00:16:36.844 --> 00:16:38.505
Crap.


00:16:41.916 --> 00:16:43.611
This is insane.


00:16:43.785 --> 00:16:47.846
Yeah, try the shed, it's unlocked, idiot.


00:16:57.632 --> 00:16:59.725
You gotta be kidding me.


00:17:01.469 --> 00:17:03.096
Crap.


00:17:06.407 --> 00:17:10.002
How did such an untalented daughter
spring from my loins?


00:17:10.178 --> 00:17:13.978
Focus, Ms. Gail. We are making
an offering to your personal deity.


00:17:14.148 --> 00:17:16.275
Tell him to give me fame and fortune.


00:17:16.451 --> 00:17:18.146
Not exactly how it works.


00:17:18.319 --> 00:17:20.879
<i>Now, breathe through your Mula Bandha.</i>


00:17:21.055 --> 00:17:24.115
Oh, honey, if I could do that,
I'd get a million hits on YouTube.


00:17:24.292 --> 00:17:26.522
How much longer is this gonna take?
Ugh.


00:17:26.694 --> 00:17:28.821
The prayer or the fame and fortune?


00:17:31.165 --> 00:17:32.632
Ha, ha. See you later.


00:17:38.806 --> 00:17:40.671
Victor.


00:17:44.512 --> 00:17:45.945
Katie?


00:17:47.148 --> 00:17:49.378
- Luke.
- Katie.


00:17:49.584 --> 00:17:52.849
- Are you wearing a doormat?
- Yes.


00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:55.784
- Welcome.
- Why, thank you.


00:17:56.824 --> 00:17:58.655
The truth. Um...


00:17:59.961 --> 00:18:03.294
My stepbrother locked me
outside of the house.


00:18:03.464 --> 00:18:04.795
Naked.


00:18:05.833 --> 00:18:08.131
Oh, sorry. You should...
You should take my jacket.


00:18:08.302 --> 00:18:09.826
Oh.
- Oh, no, no.


00:18:12.273 --> 00:18:13.365
There.


00:18:13.541 --> 00:18:16.738
- Thanks. Now the pants.
- Hmm?


00:18:21.349 --> 00:18:22.976
I'm kidding.


00:18:23.518 --> 00:18:25.349
- You got me.
- Ha, ha.


00:18:25.686 --> 00:18:26.710
No, no.


00:18:26.888 --> 00:18:30.289
One more parent-teacher conference,
I swear I'm gonna lose it.


00:18:30.458 --> 00:18:32.653
Look at me. I'm an educator.


00:18:33.261 --> 00:18:37.925
I have no real skills. And I will die
before I go back to my daddy's farm.


00:18:38.432 --> 00:18:42.232
You tell my personal deity
to help me achieve Guy Morgan. Do it.


00:18:42.403 --> 00:18:44.997
I'll put another banana on the altar.


00:18:48.876 --> 00:18:50.537
What is that?


00:18:51.112 --> 00:18:53.376
Do you hear angels singing?


00:18:53.548 --> 00:18:55.516
Perhaps the gods
have answered your prayer.


00:18:56.717 --> 00:18:58.446
Hey. What...?


00:19:11.299 --> 00:19:13.790
<i>- This is Gail Van Ravensway.
Hello.</i>


00:19:13.968 --> 00:19:15.595
Guy Morgan here. How are you?


00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:17.897
Oh, well, hello, Guy.


00:19:18.072 --> 00:19:20.336
What a surprise
to see you calling this number.


00:19:20.508 --> 00:19:21.532
Do you hear this?


00:19:21.709 --> 00:19:23.370
<i>I can justify</i>


00:19:23.544 --> 00:19:25.239
That's the demo your girl, Katie...


00:19:25.413 --> 00:19:27.745
<i>... slipped into my briefcase.</i>


00:19:27.915 --> 00:19:30.110
And it sounds like money, dear.


00:19:30.284 --> 00:19:32.149
She gave you a CD?


00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:35.687
Oh, well. Well, ain't that the berries.


00:19:36.924 --> 00:19:40.792
Ravi, what frigging god did you pray to?


00:19:42.029 --> 00:19:46.125
Guy, yeah, it seems someone's
not being entirely honest here.


00:19:48.102 --> 00:19:50.297
Katie, somebody get that door!


00:19:51.439 --> 00:19:52.997
So...


00:19:53.875 --> 00:19:56.002
...that meeting today...


00:19:56.177 --> 00:19:58.975
...it was obvious
that your dad doesn't get you.


00:19:59.313 --> 00:20:01.372
He's an idiot for not liking your music.


00:20:01.549 --> 00:20:03.983
Well, it's... It's complicated.


00:20:04.252 --> 00:20:05.446
I'm gonna just, uh...


00:20:06.921 --> 00:20:08.821
Is it as complicated as me...


00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:12.118
...getting stuck outside
in only a welcome mat?


00:20:12.393 --> 00:20:16.124
That's not complicated.
That is a gift from God.


00:20:21.035 --> 00:20:23.833
Luke. Katie. What are you doing?


00:20:24.005 --> 00:20:27.065
Well, it seems your brother
is Satan's very own personal Mini-Me.


00:20:27.241 --> 00:20:29.505
Oh, I know, tell me about it. Come on in.


00:20:33.481 --> 00:20:35.142
Oh, my God, did you work out today?


00:20:36.817 --> 00:20:38.114
- Sit down.
- Ooh, look at this.


00:20:38.286 --> 00:20:41.380
- Ha, ha. Some lemonade.
- Why, thank you.


00:20:41.555 --> 00:20:44.023
You know, my stepsister,
she has body issues...


00:20:44.191 --> 00:20:46.352
...so I don't like
to discourage her nudity.


00:20:46.527 --> 00:20:47.721
That's interesting.


00:20:47.895 --> 00:20:50.659
- She's absolutely lovely...
- Would you like an appetizer?


00:20:50.831 --> 00:20:52.059
<i>Oh, fromage.</i>


00:20:52.233 --> 00:20:53.860
I only have cheese.


00:20:57.038 --> 00:20:59.006
I just got off the phone
with Guy Morgan.


00:20:59.173 --> 00:21:01.073
Your phone.


00:21:04.111 --> 00:21:06.978
He just loved that little demo
you left him.


00:21:07.148 --> 00:21:08.706
I have underestimated you.


00:21:09.283 --> 00:21:11.114
It'd make me proud
if I cared about you.


00:21:11.285 --> 00:21:14.379
- I didn't lie about anything.
- Oh, but, chicken, you did.


00:21:14.555 --> 00:21:17.183
At least that's what Guy thinks,
now that I've clarified.


00:21:17.358 --> 00:21:21.556
I told him it was Bev's demo
and that you stole it from her.


00:21:21.729 --> 00:21:24.994
- But you can't do that. That's my song.
- It's Bev's song.


00:21:25.166 --> 00:21:28.602
And Guy can't wait to see her perform it
at the Showcase.


00:21:28.769 --> 00:21:31.897
If you try to contact him, I'll deny
everything and lock you in the basement.


00:21:32.073 --> 00:21:37.204
- She can't sing to save her life.
- No, but you can, can't you?


00:21:38.479 --> 00:21:40.640
Now, let's hear this amazing voice.


00:21:46.053 --> 00:21:50.683
<i>Like a malignant tumor
She's got no sense of humor</i>


00:21:50.858 --> 00:21:54.954
<i>Just like a swollen blister
It's best to just resist her</i>


00:21:55.129 --> 00:21:58.895
<i>She's not exactly a witch
She's just a terrible bi...</i>


00:21:59.367 --> 00:22:01.028
Well, your lyrics stink.


00:22:01.202 --> 00:22:03.363
But Guy's right, you've got chops.


00:22:06.607 --> 00:22:09.303
Do you know what other instruments
I'm good at?


00:22:09.877 --> 00:22:13.335
I have a feeling I could get in trouble
with a question like that.


00:22:13.781 --> 00:22:15.749
I like trouble.


00:22:17.284 --> 00:22:18.410
Hey, kids.


00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:23.156
- Good evening, Miss Van Ravensway.
- Sorry, I need you to go. Now.


00:22:23.324 --> 00:22:26.088
Family emergency. I need Bev
to help me pass a kidney stone.


00:22:26.260 --> 00:22:30.094
- So she had a lovely evening. Ta-ta.
- Are you trying to ruin my life?


00:22:30.398 --> 00:22:35.631
I have figured out a way for you
to wow Guy Morgan in the Showcase.


00:22:35.836 --> 00:22:38.304
- So you do think I've improved?
- Oh, no, honey.


00:22:38.572 --> 00:22:41.132
But my month of spiritual devotion
has taught me...


00:22:41.308 --> 00:22:43.276
...that God works in annoying ways.


00:22:43.444 --> 00:22:46.504
How am I to wow Guy Morgan
if I supposedly can't sing?


00:22:46.680 --> 00:22:49.740
You can't, but Katie can.


00:22:49.917 --> 00:22:52.613
- What?
- I know. Like I said, annoying.


00:22:52.787 --> 00:22:56.086
We'll record her voice
and you will lip synch.


00:22:56.257 --> 00:22:58.088
What if I don't want to?


00:22:59.193 --> 00:23:02.924
Don't you get snarky with me,
you ungrateful toad.


00:23:03.097 --> 00:23:05.156
- I saved your life.
- You didn't do anything.


00:23:05.332 --> 00:23:07.596
- My dad married you.
- Yeah, and then he died.


00:23:07.768 --> 00:23:11.329
I tried to put you in foster care,
but they was all fulled up on ugly.


00:23:11.505 --> 00:23:12.995
- Funny.
- I thought it was...


00:23:13.174 --> 00:23:14.641
...because you don't wanna look bad.


00:23:16.243 --> 00:23:18.370
Katie, if you don't sing...


00:23:18.546 --> 00:23:21.674
...I'm gonna find a way for that savings
your dad left to disappear.


00:23:22.083 --> 00:23:26.281
That means, you forget college,
moving out, you're stuck here with me.


00:23:26.454 --> 00:23:30.288
But, pumpkin, we're gonna have
so much fun growing old together.


00:23:30.458 --> 00:23:33.359
Why don't you just have her perform
if you like her so much?


00:23:33.527 --> 00:23:35.791
Because, honey, look at you.


00:23:35.963 --> 00:23:38.090
You are a star.


00:23:38.265 --> 00:23:42.463
That is what Guy Morgan needs.
You, the star.


00:23:42.636 --> 00:23:44.194
I'm a star.


00:23:44.371 --> 00:23:48.535
- A bright, gassy star.
- Yes, you are.


00:23:48.709 --> 00:23:51.109
And Guy Morgan is gonna
give you a swimming pool...


00:23:51.278 --> 00:23:53.246
...shaped just like Colin Farrell.


00:23:53.414 --> 00:23:54.972
Every part of him.


00:23:55.149 --> 00:23:58.676
Or, Bev, you could just see every part
of Colin Farrell on the Internet.


00:23:58.853 --> 00:24:01.617
And just leave me out of this.


00:24:02.890 --> 00:24:05.450
- Okay, so how do we do this?
- First rule of Lie Club...


00:24:05.626 --> 00:24:07.526
...is don't talk about Lie Club.


00:24:08.129 --> 00:24:10.029
Which includes you, Katie.


00:24:10.197 --> 00:24:12.893
As far as everyone knows,
you can't sing.


00:24:13.067 --> 00:24:15.126
And no more talking to Luke or Guy.


00:24:15.302 --> 00:24:16.667
Are we clear?


00:24:17.104 --> 00:24:18.298
Crystal.


00:24:20.241 --> 00:24:23.233
Yeah, Dad, we're about to meet
some fresh talent right now.


00:24:23.410 --> 00:24:27.403
Remember when you signed Jay-Z?
No, you passed on him, my bad.


00:24:27.581 --> 00:24:30.049
Um, this is like that,
except it's gonna be brilliant.


00:24:30.217 --> 00:24:31.548
Yeah. Okay.


00:24:31.719 --> 00:24:33.846
- Yeah, okay. Bye.
- Dude, what'd he say?


00:24:34.021 --> 00:24:35.545
These guys you told me about are good?


00:24:35.723 --> 00:24:39.090
Yes. The Oral Majority has potential.
They'll be here any second.


00:24:39.260 --> 00:24:41.956
Talking about potential,
how was your little date with Bev?


00:24:42.129 --> 00:24:44.393
- Her mom kicked me out.
- I told you. Bev is drama.


00:24:44.565 --> 00:24:46.123
Technically, it was Gail's drama.


00:24:46.300 --> 00:24:48.427
But Bev's interesting, man. She's...


00:24:48.602 --> 00:24:50.069
I'm worried she's bonkers.


00:24:50.237 --> 00:24:53.070
See, my last girlfriend, she was hot,
but absolutely mental.


00:24:53.240 --> 00:24:55.902
I need a girl who's not gonna be
shipped to the loony bin.


00:24:56.076 --> 00:24:57.839
Hang on, I'm gonna hit the facilities.


00:24:58.012 --> 00:24:59.707
Facilities. That's a new one.


00:25:00.147 --> 00:25:02.843
- Hey, man. Sorry we're late.
- Hey, what's good, y'all?


00:25:03.017 --> 00:25:05.747
Nobody talks to my boy
until he comes from the facilities.


00:25:05.920 --> 00:25:07.114
We're here to impress.


00:25:07.288 --> 00:25:09.552
- Clear, right?
- Got it.


00:25:13.394 --> 00:25:15.862
<i>When you're fighting just to keep it sane</i>


00:25:16.030 --> 00:25:18.294
<i>Throw your will
At the eye of the hurricane</i>


00:25:18.465 --> 00:25:20.660
<i>- Sing it out
- Eh-oh, eh-oh, eh-oh</i>


00:25:20.834 --> 00:25:24.201
<i>- Help me sing it out
- Eh-oh, eh-oh, eh-oh</i>


00:25:24.371 --> 00:25:26.896
<i>If you wanna find out who you are
Stop running</i>


00:25:27.074 --> 00:25:30.339
<i>In the end you'll figure out
It's all about nothing</i>


00:25:30.511 --> 00:25:35.813
<i>All night, it's gonna be all right
Hey, hey, hey, hey</i>


00:25:35.983 --> 00:25:42.718
<i>All right
Turn your dreams into your life</i>


00:25:43.924 --> 00:25:45.414
That's good.


00:25:52.466 --> 00:25:55.765
I'm clean. No one followed me.
And I got your intel.


00:25:56.604 --> 00:25:58.936
Oh, Katie, baby, your life sucks.


00:25:59.106 --> 00:26:01.006
Trust me, it gets worse.


00:26:02.042 --> 00:26:05.637
Okay, dude, those guys, they
just went Oral Majority on me in there...


00:26:05.813 --> 00:26:08.008
- I was trying to hold them back...
- You're right.


00:26:08.182 --> 00:26:10.116
They have potential and they're great.


00:26:10.284 --> 00:26:15.517
But first, my talent-finding friend,
promise me no more auditions in the bogs.


00:26:15.689 --> 00:26:17.884
- The what?
- The loo.


00:26:18.425 --> 00:26:20.188
- Bathroom. Toilet.
- Got it.


00:26:20.361 --> 00:26:22.955
All right. Okay, come on.
I wanna show you something.


00:26:23.564 --> 00:26:26.863
So now I have to rehearse in secret.


00:26:27.034 --> 00:26:28.501
Why not not rehearse?


00:26:28.669 --> 00:26:30.694
Make Bev sound bad. What do you care?


00:26:30.871 --> 00:26:33.863
No song, no savings account. No life.


00:26:36.043 --> 00:26:38.477
People. Coming. Now.


00:26:42.016 --> 00:26:43.847
Okay.


00:26:44.418 --> 00:26:46.784
Dude, what are we doing?
The suspense is killing me.


00:26:47.121 --> 00:26:48.884
Can you grab the mike?


00:26:49.056 --> 00:26:51.047
Not about to serenade
a brother, are you?


00:26:51.225 --> 00:26:53.056
Dude, with bromance, comes a fine line.


00:26:53.227 --> 00:26:55.525
That I shall not cross.


00:26:55.996 --> 00:26:58.294
So sing something.


00:26:59.967 --> 00:27:01.434
Okay.


00:27:05.572 --> 00:27:08.370
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


00:27:08.542 --> 00:27:11.033
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made</i>


00:27:11.211 --> 00:27:12.610
<i>Oh, oh</i>


00:27:13.080 --> 00:27:15.071
<i>Whoa, oh, oh, oh</i>


00:27:16.884 --> 00:27:19.352
<i>My soul's in debt, but my bills are paid</i>


00:27:19.520 --> 00:27:22.045
<i>I'd give anything just to make an escape</i>


00:27:22.222 --> 00:27:23.814
<i>Oh, oh</i>


00:27:24.325 --> 00:27:25.952
<i>Whoa, oh, oh, oh</i>


00:27:26.960 --> 00:27:29.895
<i>So you can keep
Knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


00:27:30.064 --> 00:27:32.396
<i>Baby, you're rockin'
But there ain't no way I'm ever letting you in</i>


00:27:32.566 --> 00:27:34.033
<i>He's amazing.</i>


00:27:35.436 --> 00:27:37.097
<i>Not again</i>


00:27:38.038 --> 00:27:40.871
<i>So keep on
Knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


00:27:41.041 --> 00:27:46.240
<i>But, baby, you're better off walking
'Cause I ain't gonna let you in</i>


00:27:46.413 --> 00:27:47.971
<i>Never again</i>


00:27:49.083 --> 00:27:51.677
<i>I went out on a limb again</i>


00:27:51.852 --> 00:27:54.412
<i>I guess I had to lose to win</i>


00:27:54.588 --> 00:27:58.957
<i>I was too confused to know
Which way to turn</i>


00:28:00.361 --> 00:28:03.023
<i>- And she could be a millionaire...
- Crap.</i>


00:28:03.197 --> 00:28:05.461
<i>- Gail needs me to drive her home.
- I don't care</i>


00:28:05.632 --> 00:28:08.294
<i>'Cause, baby, there's nobody home</i>


00:28:08.469 --> 00:28:10.960
<i>Nobody's home at all, yeah</i>


00:28:15.442 --> 00:28:17.569
- What? Did you write that?
- Yeah.


00:28:17.745 --> 00:28:20.373
Reminds me of, um... Uh...


00:28:20.547 --> 00:28:23.880
- Danger Fruit, right? Danger Fruit.
- Ha, ha. Because I wrote their album too.


00:28:24.151 --> 00:28:26.642
Shut up. Took me forever
to find that bootleg online.


00:28:26.820 --> 00:28:28.811
- I love that album. That's crazy.
- Yeah.


00:28:28.989 --> 00:28:31.287
My dad doesn't know.
And he thought the record...


00:28:31.458 --> 00:28:33.153
...was a pile of crap.


00:28:33.427 --> 00:28:35.122
He thinks writing's a waste of time.


00:28:35.562 --> 00:28:39.396
Because he basically wants me
to be like him. Only with better hair.


00:28:39.867 --> 00:28:43.963
But the first thing I thought when
I heard those guys in the urinals was...


00:28:44.138 --> 00:28:45.162
...good acoustics.


00:28:45.572 --> 00:28:49.406
Second thought was these guys,
these guys could be great.


00:28:49.576 --> 00:28:51.168
If you gave them your song.


00:28:52.579 --> 00:28:54.240
Mate, that's a brilliant idea.


00:28:54.982 --> 00:28:57.678
- So put them in the Showcase?
- Put them in the Showcase.


00:28:57.851 --> 00:28:59.182
Yeah.


00:29:00.854 --> 00:29:07.384
<i>You can never tell where this might go</i>


00:29:07.694 --> 00:29:08.991
You wrote that song today?


00:29:09.163 --> 00:29:12.621
- You've been home for what, two hours?
- It's like an answer to his song.


00:29:12.900 --> 00:29:14.197
You really like this guy.


00:29:14.368 --> 00:29:16.063
Yeah, I'm an idiot.


00:29:16.236 --> 00:29:18.431
You have to sing that for him.


00:29:18.605 --> 00:29:22.097
What if you sang to him in secret?


00:29:23.911 --> 00:29:26.709
At the dance. Ta-da.


00:29:30.317 --> 00:29:33.150
Okay, I know the card's
like, really cheesy, but...


00:29:35.189 --> 00:29:37.657
Oh, God, I hope you like it.


00:29:37.991 --> 00:29:41.483
Ange, it's beautiful,
but are you crazy?


00:29:41.662 --> 00:29:43.687
No, I know you're crazy.


00:29:43.864 --> 00:29:44.888
Am not.


00:29:45.933 --> 00:29:48.925
- What if he doesn't even like me?
- You'll both be in disguise.


00:29:49.102 --> 00:29:51.798
It's your chance to see
if he was really flirting with you.


00:29:51.972 --> 00:29:54.532
I was naked. Of course he was flirting.


00:29:54.708 --> 00:29:57.404
And why even torture myself?
It's not like I can have him.


00:29:57.578 --> 00:29:59.512
Why not? Tell him how you feel.


00:29:59.680 --> 00:30:03.707
If he feels the same way, you can reveal
your hot self and he won't tell Gail.


00:30:04.084 --> 00:30:07.178
And if he hates the song,
leave the disguise on.


00:30:10.123 --> 00:30:11.647
Okay.


00:30:11.959 --> 00:30:13.551
I'm going to the dance.


00:30:13.727 --> 00:30:15.058
That's my girl.


00:30:15.329 --> 00:30:19.322
<i>Maurice, no, no.
Again, in Français, longer legs.</i>


00:30:19.500 --> 00:30:22.799
I wouldn't go in your closet
for a little while if I were you.


00:30:22.970 --> 00:30:24.733
What? Why?


00:30:24.905 --> 00:30:26.270
Hey. Wake up.


00:30:30.177 --> 00:30:31.735
Katie!


00:30:31.912 --> 00:30:35.348
The cat has pooped in my closet.
I need you to clean it up.


00:30:35.516 --> 00:30:37.006
Go.


00:30:37.184 --> 00:30:38.913
I told you we don't have a cat.


00:30:39.086 --> 00:30:40.417
Angie, heads up.


00:30:42.389 --> 00:30:43.686
Katie!


00:30:48.896 --> 00:30:50.625
What's going on?


00:30:50.797 --> 00:30:52.230
Nothing.


00:30:52.399 --> 00:30:55.527
I am, uh, re-organizing and labeling. I...


00:30:55.702 --> 00:30:58.000
I took up crochet.
Do you want new socks?


00:30:58.171 --> 00:31:02.232
I would make you a sweater, but I hear
that the arms, that they're really hard.


00:31:05.479 --> 00:31:09.643
Oh, you thought you could sneak off
and go to the dance.


00:31:09.816 --> 00:31:12.046
After what you pulled today with Guy.


00:31:12.219 --> 00:31:13.652
Oh, no, no.


00:31:13.820 --> 00:31:16.311
Oh, no, no, no.


00:31:16.490 --> 00:31:18.788
You're on Victor watch tonight...


00:31:18.959 --> 00:31:21.655
...tomorrow night and every night.


00:31:21.828 --> 00:31:22.852
Fun.


00:31:23.030 --> 00:31:26.158
I'll give Victor all the mothering
you don't have time for.


00:31:26.333 --> 00:31:29.734
Oh, I wish you could be my mommy.


00:31:30.604 --> 00:31:32.629
I'm off to my cinnamon colonic.


00:31:36.610 --> 00:31:38.976
Hey. Get down.
You're gonna break yourself.


00:31:39.313 --> 00:31:41.577
Or worse, the furniture.


00:31:41.882 --> 00:31:44.976
Hello?
- Hey.


00:31:45.252 --> 00:31:48.415
- You look like you're having fun.
- Always.


00:31:48.755 --> 00:31:51.815
Well, I couldn't let you not go to the dance
without me.


00:31:51.992 --> 00:31:54.392
Besides, we have six hours
of shirtless Team Jacob.


00:31:54.561 --> 00:31:57.496
So let's just get this party started.


00:31:57.664 --> 00:32:01.691
- So is Victor driving you nuts?
- I swear to you, he's not human.


00:32:01.969 --> 00:32:05.268
I mean, can you really blame him, though?
Just look at this family.


00:32:06.473 --> 00:32:07.770
Victor, what are you doing?


00:32:17.751 --> 00:32:20.015
Oh, no. Great.


00:32:20.187 --> 00:32:22.382
Eh, she actually looks prettier
that way.


00:32:22.990 --> 00:32:26.016
True. Ugh. Whatever.


00:32:27.194 --> 00:32:30.322
Why did I ever think that tonight
could've been something special.


00:32:31.098 --> 00:32:33.362
Think Bev's all over Luke at the dance
right now?


00:32:33.533 --> 00:32:35.831
They're probably making out. See?


00:32:36.003 --> 00:32:39.200
- Victor, give it a rest.
- Just check it out. Come on.


00:32:42.409 --> 00:32:45.037
<i>Luke is gonna produce
whoever wins the Showcase.</i>


00:32:45.212 --> 00:32:48.272
<i>So we need a little insurance.</i>


00:32:48.448 --> 00:32:51.645
<i>- I know what I'm doing, Mother.
Do you?</i>


00:32:52.552 --> 00:32:55.419
I can't take it anymore, okay?


00:32:55.589 --> 00:32:57.648
I'm taking my life into my own hands.


00:32:57.824 --> 00:32:58.916
I'm talking to Luke.


00:32:59.526 --> 00:33:02.017
- Finally.
- Okay, but we have gotta be home...


00:33:02.195 --> 00:33:03.662
...before Gail gets here.


00:33:04.398 --> 00:33:05.729
What about the demon spawn?


00:33:05.899 --> 00:33:06.923
Mm-hm.


00:33:07.100 --> 00:33:08.499
Right.


00:33:09.503 --> 00:33:10.902
Okay, just watch him.


00:33:13.974 --> 00:33:15.236
Hmm.


00:33:20.047 --> 00:33:22.038
Is that all you've got, Angela?


00:33:22.716 --> 00:33:23.740
Ravi?


00:33:25.419 --> 00:33:27.944
My sister could catch that, jerknut.


00:33:28.121 --> 00:33:30.555
Put some nuts in that sack, ref.


00:33:32.693 --> 00:33:35.253
Miss Katie, I am most startled.


00:33:35.429 --> 00:33:36.623
Obviously.


00:33:37.164 --> 00:33:39.655
All right. All right. Don't hate me.


00:33:39.833 --> 00:33:41.391
Okay, don't hate me. I'm sorry.


00:33:41.568 --> 00:33:44.935
But my name ain't Ravi. It's Tony.


00:33:45.472 --> 00:33:48.600
- Tony.
- Tony Gupta from Jersey.


00:33:48.775 --> 00:33:51.437
- From Jersey.
- I am half Indian.


00:33:51.812 --> 00:33:55.213
My friends call me Meatball
because I'm half Italian.


00:33:55.382 --> 00:33:57.247
Truth is I always wanted to be an actor.


00:33:57.617 --> 00:33:59.141
But I never got my shot.


00:33:59.319 --> 00:34:01.549
I'm working at KFC,
and one day, Gail comes in...


00:34:01.722 --> 00:34:04.122
...she's like, "Are you Indian?"
I'm like, "What?"


00:34:04.291 --> 00:34:06.486
She's like, "Are you a guru?"
I'm like:


00:34:06.660 --> 00:34:08.150
"Who is asking?"


00:34:08.428 --> 00:34:11.795
She says, "Someone
who's paying for some spiritual guidance."


00:34:11.965 --> 00:34:14.559
And I'm like, "Whaa! It's a miracle!"


00:34:14.735 --> 00:34:19.104
I finally get a chance to do
a total immersion into a character.


00:34:19.406 --> 00:34:21.670
Real training and I get paid.
Are you kidding me?


00:34:21.842 --> 00:34:24.242
Ravi is my King Lear.


00:34:24.578 --> 00:34:27.206
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


00:34:27.380 --> 00:34:28.574
- Oy, mate.
- No, thanks.


00:34:29.783 --> 00:34:32.479
I'm sorry I barged in. Whoops.


00:34:35.288 --> 00:34:38.951
Your secret's safe with me, okay?
But I need to ask you a favor.


00:34:39.626 --> 00:34:41.685
- Meatball.
- Ha, Meatball.


00:34:41.862 --> 00:34:44.330
Please watch Victor tonight
so I can go to the dance?


00:34:44.498 --> 00:34:45.556
Are you kidding me? Done.


00:34:47.134 --> 00:34:48.465
Blow it up.


00:34:50.403 --> 00:34:51.961
Thank you.


00:35:01.782 --> 00:35:03.181
Whoa.


00:35:03.350 --> 00:35:05.978
How am I supposed to find Luke
if everybody's got a mask?


00:35:06.153 --> 00:35:09.213
I never said this was
gonna be easy. Let's do some recon.


00:35:10.590 --> 00:35:12.922
I am Assistant Principal
Dorothy Plumberg.


00:35:13.093 --> 00:35:16.324
No drinking. No texting. No kissing.


00:35:19.032 --> 00:35:22.001
Luke? No. Luke Morgan?


00:35:22.169 --> 00:35:25.798
No leaving the premises
and no experiencing joy of any kind.


00:35:26.506 --> 00:35:28.838
Luke? Ugh.


00:35:34.214 --> 00:35:35.647
Where is he?


00:35:36.483 --> 00:35:39.281
That reminds me.
I got a new act for you to listen to.


00:35:39.452 --> 00:35:41.113
- Now?
- No time like it.


00:35:41.288 --> 00:35:43.722
- Dude, not again...
- We're called Big Pain Ticket.


00:35:47.227 --> 00:35:50.788
<i>I wanna kiss your apocalypse</i>


00:35:50.964 --> 00:35:54.297
<i>Wrap you in my Armageddon</i>


00:35:54.467 --> 00:35:56.662
<i>Sing you a twisted serenade</i>


00:35:56.870 --> 00:35:59.600
They're good, but I'm worried
that chain saw's unsafe.


00:35:59.773 --> 00:36:02.207
Dude, the chain saw's,
like, the best part.


00:36:09.015 --> 00:36:10.073
I think I found him.


00:36:10.250 --> 00:36:12.514
Well, he is blond.


00:36:15.622 --> 00:36:17.920
Oh, my God, what is she doing here?


00:36:19.826 --> 00:36:22.124
I hate teenage desperation.


00:36:22.295 --> 00:36:23.694
What are you doing here?


00:36:23.864 --> 00:36:26.697
Oh, honey, the prize pig
doesn't win the blue ribbon...


00:36:26.867 --> 00:36:28.892
...by covering up its third best asset.


00:36:29.069 --> 00:36:32.004
A, what does that even mean
and, B, did you just call me a pig?


00:36:32.172 --> 00:36:34.003
Honey, I saw you making sweet love...


00:36:34.174 --> 00:36:36.642
...to a plate of Swedish meatballs
at the snack table.


00:36:39.079 --> 00:36:41.206
It's now or never, babe.


00:36:42.749 --> 00:36:46.185
- What if she recognizes me?
- I'll distract her. Go.


00:36:46.353 --> 00:36:48.548
- So was I right or was I right?
- You were right.


00:36:48.722 --> 00:36:51.589
You have very cool taste.
Any more auditions in the men's...


00:36:51.758 --> 00:36:53.692
...and you're fired.


00:36:56.730 --> 00:37:00.257
- I know your secret.
- Which secret is that?


00:37:02.869 --> 00:37:04.359
I heard you sing at school.


00:37:04.604 --> 00:37:05.730
You were amazing.


00:37:05.906 --> 00:37:06.964
Do I know you?


00:37:11.311 --> 00:37:13.905
- I wanna show you something.
- What's your name?


00:37:16.249 --> 00:37:18.308
Angela, what are you doing?


00:37:18.952 --> 00:37:21.443
I'd like to make a request.


00:37:25.959 --> 00:37:28.792
I will make your night. I promise.


00:37:28.962 --> 00:37:30.327
Miss Van R.


00:37:30.964 --> 00:37:33.364
Is it true you wanted to be a dancer
when you were younger...


00:37:33.533 --> 00:37:34.727
...but were never good enough?


00:37:36.102 --> 00:37:37.763
Who told you that?


00:37:55.488 --> 00:37:56.921
Well, now, how lovely.


00:37:57.090 --> 00:38:00.287
But I've seen better dancing
in a Filipino prison, sugar.


00:38:00.460 --> 00:38:01.586
Oh!


00:38:01.761 --> 00:38:05.993
Really? Because I think
I just challenged you to a dance battle.


00:38:10.337 --> 00:38:13.431
Would Luke Morgan please pick up
the white courtesy phone?


00:38:13.606 --> 00:38:16.507
Luke Morgan, white courtesy phone.


00:38:21.281 --> 00:38:24.011
Hold on. What is that?
You've never seen a guitar before?


00:38:24.351 --> 00:38:27.047
You hid a guitar in there.
You hiding anything else?


00:38:27.220 --> 00:38:28.482
Follow me.


00:38:33.526 --> 00:38:35.357
Oh, wow.


00:38:37.831 --> 00:38:43.394
Madam, while your exquisite eyes
tell of a radiant, but mischievous beauty...


00:38:44.270 --> 00:38:46.170
...I have grown impatient.


00:38:46.339 --> 00:38:50.036
Off with your veil,
so that I may know the truth.


00:38:51.544 --> 00:38:52.738
Or not.


00:38:55.015 --> 00:38:58.041
I'm hoping this answers
a lot of your questions.


00:39:04.257 --> 00:39:07.818
<i>I can see it from the spark in your eyes</i>


00:39:09.129 --> 00:39:13.361
<i>You believe in all the things
You've denied</i>


00:39:13.533 --> 00:39:17.060
<i>You wanna fly
And leave your worries behind</i>


00:39:17.237 --> 00:39:21.230
<i>Don't you? Don't you?</i>


00:39:23.209 --> 00:39:26.542
<i>Well, now I'm knocking
At your front door</i>


00:39:28.314 --> 00:39:32.011
<i>And I'm looking for the right cure</i>


00:39:32.685 --> 00:39:36.382
<i>I'm still a little bit unsure</i>


00:39:36.856 --> 00:39:39.689
Okay, now take off that veil.


00:39:40.160 --> 00:39:41.252
Uh-uh.


00:42:20.186 --> 00:42:22.780
I think I've blown something.


00:42:22.956 --> 00:42:26.016
Does anyone else smell cinnamon?


00:42:28.628 --> 00:42:30.186
Move it, fatso.


00:42:31.931 --> 00:42:38.530
<i>You can never tell where this might go</i>


00:42:39.272 --> 00:42:42.901
Okay, you are blowing my mind.
You have to show me who you are.


00:42:55.455 --> 00:42:56.888
- We have to go.
- What?


00:42:57.056 --> 00:42:59.081
- Come.
- No, Ange.


00:42:59.259 --> 00:43:01.819
In the middle of a really big moment
right now.


00:43:01.995 --> 00:43:03.963
Someone had an accident
and went home.


00:43:06.432 --> 00:43:07.797
I'm so sorry.


00:43:08.501 --> 00:43:09.729
What...? You...?


00:43:10.436 --> 00:43:12.097
Hey. Wait.


00:43:12.272 --> 00:43:13.500
But who are you?


00:43:13.673 --> 00:43:16.267
Over here. Go, go, go.


00:43:24.417 --> 00:43:27.443
- We beat her.
- I love you for this.


00:43:45.905 --> 00:43:47.930
Interesting babysitting attire.


00:43:48.708 --> 00:43:51.643
I should've known
you'd go behind my back again.


00:43:52.078 --> 00:43:55.013
And that Paula Abdul wannabe,
trying to distract me.


00:43:55.348 --> 00:43:57.543
Don't talk about her like that.


00:43:59.552 --> 00:44:02.715
Your friend wants to be a choreographer,
if memory serves.


00:44:02.889 --> 00:44:06.450
She might've made a decent one
if she hadn't gotten herself expelled.


00:44:06.626 --> 00:44:08.890
Guess she can kiss
them Juilliard dreams goodbye.


00:44:09.062 --> 00:44:12.122
Look, I'll do whatever you want.
Okay? Just leave Ange out of this.


00:44:12.432 --> 00:44:15.560
That depends if you pull another stunt
like tonight, sugar.


00:44:16.469 --> 00:44:19.597
- I won't.
- I'll be taking this.


00:44:26.112 --> 00:44:29.343
Only her eyes were piercing out
through this veil, but her voice...


00:44:29.515 --> 00:44:31.574
How hot was the girl
on a scale of one to 10?


00:44:31.751 --> 00:44:33.685
- An 11.
- The hotness scale only goes 10.


00:44:33.853 --> 00:44:35.548
Yeah, this girl has love potential.


00:44:35.722 --> 00:44:38.020
- Ooh, love.
- Shut it.


00:44:39.392 --> 00:44:43.522
We are gonna do this for hours
until we get it right. Even if it takes hours.


00:44:44.497 --> 00:44:48.092
Now, sing like your life depends on it.
Because, sugar, it does.


00:44:49.168 --> 00:44:50.795
We're recording.


00:44:51.104 --> 00:44:52.935
<i>Plug in the mike</i>


00:44:53.106 --> 00:44:54.334
<i>Open the curtain</i>


00:44:54.941 --> 00:44:56.875
<i>Turn on the lights</i>


00:44:57.043 --> 00:44:58.772
<i>I'm through rehearsing</i>


00:44:58.945 --> 00:45:01.277
- Dang, she's good, man.
- Told you, man.


00:45:01.447 --> 00:45:02.675
Check this out, all right?


00:45:02.849 --> 00:45:06.444
Thirty-nine girls in the singing program
which means 85 percent...


00:45:06.619 --> 00:45:08.450
...have music during the sixth period.


00:45:08.621 --> 00:45:10.452
So your girl's in one of those rooms.


00:45:10.656 --> 00:45:12.681
<i>The feeling ignites</i>


00:45:12.859 --> 00:45:14.019
<i>I'm in control</i>


00:45:14.193 --> 00:45:16.161
Oh, cut. Cut.


00:45:16.329 --> 00:45:18.194
That was subpar at best.


00:45:18.364 --> 00:45:20.889
From the top, pretty please.


00:45:21.634 --> 00:45:24.933
<i>Amazing grace</i>


00:45:25.104 --> 00:45:26.662
It's cool, I got this.


00:45:26.839 --> 00:45:29.205
Ladies, all my single ladies.


00:45:29.375 --> 00:45:32.401
My boy Luke here has a special favor
to ask of you, all right?


00:45:32.578 --> 00:45:35.672
He needs vocals
for this big show coming up, so...


00:45:35.848 --> 00:45:37.406
- My name is...
- Luke Morgan.


00:45:37.850 --> 00:45:40.717
You will put me in the Showcase.
Oh, yes, you will.


00:45:41.254 --> 00:45:44.815
- Maybe I could ask you to sing first?
- I am so gonna rock your world.


00:45:45.091 --> 00:45:48.424
<i>I love the way you love me, Luke</i>


00:45:48.594 --> 00:45:51.188
<i>Inside my head every night</i>


00:45:51.364 --> 00:45:53.832
<i>You come and kiss me good night</i>


00:45:54.000 --> 00:45:57.094
<i>Whatever you see is what you get</i>


00:45:57.270 --> 00:45:59.795
Why don't you not suck
and do it again, okay?


00:46:01.541 --> 00:46:06.137
<i>I wanna be with you forever...</i>


00:46:06.312 --> 00:46:09.281
What is going on in here? Disgusting.


00:46:09.449 --> 00:46:12.282
You two boys are not in my class.
Stop. Wait.


00:46:18.324 --> 00:46:21.521
Stop. Wait. Stop.


00:46:40.646 --> 00:46:42.944
<i>I got nothing to lose</i>


00:46:43.115 --> 00:46:44.309
<i>I've been exposed</i>


00:46:44.484 --> 00:46:46.782
<i>I'm paying my dues</i>


00:46:46.953 --> 00:46:48.318
<i>Playing the role</i>


00:46:49.155 --> 00:46:51.282
- Oh, really?
- We are back where we started.


00:46:51.457 --> 00:46:52.583
This is not good.


00:46:54.160 --> 00:46:55.957
That's her. That's her voice.


00:46:56.128 --> 00:46:57.959
Don't think you can get away from me.


00:46:58.130 --> 00:47:00.530
- Step aside. Step aside.
- Please. Wait.


00:47:00.700 --> 00:47:04.136
Okay. But first, why don't you
just both audition for me.


00:47:04.303 --> 00:47:05.327
Listen...


00:47:05.505 --> 00:47:08.941
<i>Luke, you are the one for me, yes you are</i>


00:47:09.108 --> 00:47:10.769
<i>You just don't know it yet</i>


00:47:22.622 --> 00:47:26.615
<i>Make you believe in me</i>


00:47:26.792 --> 00:47:29.784
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


00:47:29.962 --> 00:47:33.591
<i>Tonight is the night
Where I make you see</i>


00:47:33.766 --> 00:47:37.702
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


00:47:37.870 --> 00:47:41.670
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


00:47:42.208 --> 00:47:45.109
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


00:47:45.278 --> 00:47:48.338
<i>Tonight is the night
Where I make you see</i>


00:47:50.149 --> 00:47:52.083
It was you?


00:47:52.752 --> 00:47:55.846
- Oh, sorry to interrupt.
- Oh, no, honey. Interrupt away.


00:47:56.789 --> 00:48:00.623
I didn't think I'd see you. It was killing me.
Because I felt like we connected.


00:48:02.261 --> 00:48:05.287
Excuse me.
Uh, how exactly did you two connect?


00:48:05.464 --> 00:48:08.228
Yeah, how did we? I mean, we did.


00:48:08.401 --> 00:48:10.528
- Through...
- With your lyrics. They just...


00:48:11.170 --> 00:48:13.900
- I can't get them out of my head.
- My lyrics. Yeah.


00:48:14.173 --> 00:48:15.936
Well, how wonderful.


00:48:16.108 --> 00:48:19.475
But, uh, Bev has to prepare
for her Showcase audition.


00:48:19.645 --> 00:48:21.909
Oh, no. She doesn't need to audition.
You're in.


00:48:23.416 --> 00:48:25.213
Do you wanna grab a bite later?


00:48:25.384 --> 00:48:26.476
- Yeah.
Wait.


00:48:27.420 --> 00:48:28.887
You have a date with detention.


00:48:29.055 --> 00:48:30.522
Actually, he has a date with me.


00:48:30.690 --> 00:48:32.419
Dear me, did I not fire you?


00:48:32.592 --> 00:48:35.288
- I have tenure.
- One call and you're wearing a paper hat...


00:48:35.461 --> 00:48:38.589
...that says "Welcome to McDonald's.
How may I take your order?"


00:48:38.764 --> 00:48:40.254
- Five calls.
- Two calls and text.


00:48:40.433 --> 00:48:42.333
Two calls, a text, several long e-mails.


00:48:42.501 --> 00:48:45.299
One text and a Tweet.
- One text and a re-Tweet.


00:48:45.471 --> 00:48:47.837
Oh, for God's sakes,
go lick a chalkboard.


00:48:48.007 --> 00:48:49.474
Fine.


00:48:50.276 --> 00:48:51.800
I hate you.


00:48:55.448 --> 00:48:59.578
Okay. Um, I'd love to write a song with you.
Let's talk about it tonight?


00:48:59.852 --> 00:49:01.786
- I'd love to.
- Okay, you're on.


00:49:08.361 --> 00:49:09.988
I've always wanted to write a song.


00:49:10.162 --> 00:49:13.359
Maybe I'll write about my skin.
They say love tightens your pores.


00:49:13.532 --> 00:49:14.999
What rhymes with pores?


00:49:15.167 --> 00:49:17.965
Chores. Bores. Sores.


00:49:18.137 --> 00:49:20.332
Katie, I've got a new task for you.


