01:05:17.280 --> 01:05:19.111
Look, there's nothing you can do.


01:05:19.782 --> 01:05:22.148
If you try to help,
it's just gonna make it worse.


01:05:22.318 --> 01:05:25.344
That woman is a demon
spawned from darkness itself.


01:05:25.521 --> 01:05:26.852
I wish she'd go straight back to...


01:05:27.023 --> 01:05:28.854
Hello, Ms. Gail.


01:05:29.025 --> 01:05:32.426
