mac and cheese.


01:05:59.722 --> 01:06:01.917
You're annoying and ugly...


01:06:02.091 --> 01:06:03.490
...but I sort of love you.


01:06:05.928 --> 01:06:07.555
I sort of love you too.


01:06:08.164 --> 01:06:12.624
But just promise me
you're not gonna do anything, okay?


01:06:13.102 --> 01:06:14.694
- You too.
- Oh, come on.


01:06:14.870 --> 01:06:16.804
- Just... No... Ple...
- Just... No. Just...


01:06:16.972 --> 01:06:18.462
