- Ever heard of I don't care?


01:06:44.800 --> 01:06:46.961
Where'd you put my blue blouse?


01:06:47.136 --> 01:06:49.229
Oh, okay.


01:06:49.405 --> 01:06:51.930
Okay, which one of these
do you like better?


01:06:52.842 --> 01:06:56.744
