01:17:14.496 --> 01:17:16.361
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:16.531 --> 01:17:18.328
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:18.500 --> 01:17:23.870
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:26.641 --> 01:17:28.609
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:36.318 --> 01:17:40.311
<i>There's a little secret
I would like to tell you</i>


01:17:43.425 --> 01:17:48.055
<i>There's a book of lies
I know they'll try to sell you</i>


01:17:49.297 --> 01:17:52.858
