01:21:21.676 --> 01:21:23.143
Guy!


01:21:24.479 --> 01:21:28.142
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:28.383 --> 01:21:32.149
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:33.622 --> 01:21:36.682
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:36.858 --> 01:21:39.452
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:39.628 --> 01:21:41.186
Let's try this again.


01:21:41.396 --> 01:21:43.261
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:44.833 --> 01:21:47.563
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:13.228 --> 01:22:15.458
Hey. Clear.


01:22:31.146 --> 01:22:33.307
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:33.481 --> 01:22:35.847
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:17.726 --> 01:23:20.320
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:20.495 --> 01:23:23.362
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:28.336 --> 01:23:31.863
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:38.313 --> 01:23:40.372
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:45.553 --> 01:23:49.853
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:54.295 --> 01:23:57.287
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:57.465 --> 01:23:59.592
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:19.087 --> 01:24:20.952
I love my life.


01:24:21.122 --> 01:24:23.317
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:45.780 --> 01:24:48.977
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

